OL,5,G1800 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,6,     FDr Eleanor Beecraft fears her
OL,7,     Fpatient is in the middle of a
OL,8,     Fdrugs overdose. Dr William Laird
OL,9,     Fmust convince a depressed man that
OL,10,     Flife is worth living.
OL,11,G1900 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,12,     FDr Cordell has some advice for a
OL,13,     Fyoung agoraphobia sufferer, and
OL,14,     FJulie has to take a blood sample
OL,15,     Ffrom someone with a severe fear of
OL,16,     Fneedles.
