OL,5,G2000 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,6,     FBarnsley's A&E department faces an
OL,7,     Fovernight backlog and new patients
OL,8,     Fas 81-year-old Roy arrives after a
OL,9,     Ffall that may have damaged an
OL,10,     Fartificial hip and caused multiple
OL,11,     Ffracture.
OL,12,G2100 Shocking Emergency Calls
OL,13,     FEmergency services in north-east
OL,14,     FEngland receive a harrowing call
OL,15,     Ffrom a woman who has found her
OL,16,     Fflatmate dead at their home in
OL,17,     FGateshead, and a tiger loose on a
OL,18,     FUS street causes panic.
