OL,5,G2200 Cause of Death
OL,6,     FForensic pathologist Dr Richard
OL,7,     FShepherd searches for answers
OL,8,     Fdesperately needed by the families
OL,9,     Fof a teenager who died suddenly
OL,10,     Fand a 69-year-old unable to
OL,11,     Frecover from her injuries.
OL,12,G2300 Skin A&E
OL,13,     FDr Magnus Lynch tackles twin
OL,14,     Flipomas nicknamed Barry and
OL,15,     FBarbara, and a Welsh carpet fitter
OL,16,     Fneeds Dr Dev Shah to help him with
OL,17,     F'devil horns'; large cysts on
OL,18,     Feither side of his head.
