OL,5,G0000 999: Emergency Call Out
OL,6,     FA stolen car that crashed into a
OL,7,     Fbuilding, breaking a gas line in
OL,8,     Fthe process, presents a unique
OL,9,     Fchallenge to the first responders.
OL,10,G0100 Call the Bailiffs: Time to Pay Up!
OL,11,     FIn London, Scott and police
OL,12,     Fofficers remove squatters from a
OL,13,     Fcouncil-owned building where
OL,14,     Fthey've been living for nearly a
OL,15,     Fyear. But one woman barricades
OL,16,     Fherself in a room.
OL,17,G0200 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,18,     FBarnsley's A&E department is put
OL,19,     Funder the microscope. There are
OL,20,     Fcomplications when Wendy, who
OL,21,     Fsuffers from kidney failure, is
OL,22,     Fadmitted with a heart condition.
